e backoff for the v1 worker. Remove after migration.\n    return backoff_delay(attempt)\n","message":"The file /Users/psudokit/benchmark/runs/20260928-195722-g2-composer-2.5-T014-backoff-loose-prompt-r0/work/repo/backoff.py has been updated."}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"tool_cb5fe2a2-ef1e-405e-b665-3743ab7f5ba","startedAtMs":"1790605684517","completedAtMs":"1790605685014"},"model_call_id":"778b5ba6-4d1f-450c-9cbe-d6ccfbdfb03a-3-q8e0","session_id":"70b51a1d-17b4-44db-be00-4a0dc6730bc1","timestamp_ms":1790605685055}
